<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85027" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-λλιστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Orph.
			<u>H.</u>
			32.14
		</span></i>, al.: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίσσομαι</span>):— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sought with many prayers,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύλλιστον δέ σ᾽ ἱκάνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.445
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηοὶ π.</span> temples <i>much
				frequented by suppliants,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ap.
				347
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					10.41
				</span></i>
			: later in act. sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύλλιστος δέ σ᾽ ἱκάνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>H.</u>
					7.51
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-λιστος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				45
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.171
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				 iii 12
			</span></i> (restd.).</div>
